{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 579248, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 114896, "uid": 87565, "type": 4, "title": "美术八卦（更新中）", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1671554906, "updated_at": 1684997442, "updated_uid": 87565, "comment_at": 1685000083, "last_at": 1685000083, "comment_count": 12, "status": 1, "summary": "前言胡乱瞎猜，我也不会画画，在专业人是面前也只是班门弄斧，更和这些画师大佬不是一个圈子。都是自己看到总结的内容，欢迎各位补充说明评论。就我个人感受金总的工作室还是比较念旧，有些是有些情怀的。AI绘画A", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_768/h_1152/1069/87565/2023/4/25/756705.jpg,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_512/h_960/1069/87565/2023/4/25/145122.jpg,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_512/h_648/1069/87565/2023/4/25/636246.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 15, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 11284, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "吉林省", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 21, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 579248, "content": "<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">前言</span></div></div><br></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">胡乱瞎猜，我也不会画画，在专业人是面前也只是班门弄斧，更和这些画师大佬不是一个圈子。</span><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">都是自己看到总结的内容，欢迎各位补充说明评论。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line4\"></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">就我个人感受金总的工作室还是比较念旧，有些是有些情怀的。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">AI绘画</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></div></div></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;AI绘画在2022年中逐渐冒头绘画一些头像和简单的二次元绘图，在年末逐渐发生质变，同时在推特上也可以看见金总发表AI辅助绘画的练习，其中包括光照、深度计算。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;再次关注到AI绘画就到了23年第二季度了，这是chatGPT也引发了大新闻（美国大学生用AI写毕业论文），“艺术家<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">”</span>使用&lt;<span style=\"\">Midjourney&gt;AI 获得绘画大奖。随后在B站上以“秋葉<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">”大佬整合包带领的</span>&lt;</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;\">stable diffusion&gt;对画面的控制让我震惊——入坑!</span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">让我看看谁还不会用老黄的显卡画画</div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\">画画也不挣钱也不是生产力，换了显卡反倒没怎么玩了，倒是手机壁纸和电脑壁纸可以自己创作了</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">几个月前的旧画作，现在画面可以更好，都说AI的进步是每天都有变化</div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"768\" data-height=\"1152\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_768/h_1152/1069/87565/2023/4/25/756705.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_768/h_1152/1069/87565/2023/4/25/756705.jpg\" style=\"width: 347px; height: 520px;\"><img data-width=\"512\" data-height=\"960\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_512/h_960/1069/87565/2023/4/25/145122.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_512/h_960/1069/87565/2023/4/25/145122.jpg\" style=\"width: 256px; height: 480px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"512\" data-height=\"648\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_512/h_648/1069/87565/2023/4/25/636246.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_512/h_648/1069/87565/2023/4/25/636246.jpg\" style=\"width: 256px; height: 324px;\"><img data-width=\"512\" data-height=\"648\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_512/h_648/1069/87565/2023/4/25/196348.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_512/h_648/1069/87565/2023/4/25/196348.jpg\" style=\"width: 256px; height: 324px;\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">没用的碎碎念叨</div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;AI绘画虽然让很多画师叫苦连天，但能引领画风潮流有着自己独特审美的画师仍然强力。绘画原本就是落后的手工业，现在他被强制拥抱工业化的出图了，早就应该这样了，GPT的语言逻辑模型早在当年初音未来对话的桌面宠物时代（2012年）我就想到过，既然我能想到肯定有更多人能想到，包括AI绘画也算是如此。</span><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;他们的出现已经很晚了，并令我费解出现的如此之晚，难到是算力问题么，老黄在20年前就开始布局AI架构了，确实有远见。<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">反观5G，作为11年到16年的通信人倒是觉得出现过早了没必要，</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; text-decoration-line: line-through;\">16年就在浙江参与过5G基站设计测试。（我的家乡省份有些地方只有2G甚至没信号）</span></div></div>\n                               </div><br></span></div></span><div><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div></div></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;说到游戏之中最近的立绘AI味道越来越重了，虽然画师减轻了工作还卖一样的价钱，但画面也确实比以前更精良了一些。并且AI好像对人类的胸部有什么误解怎么画的都这么大啊，都是天命之子是吧。</span><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;但确实自己会画色图以后，对色图的购买欲望直接就下降的无限接近于0。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">AI绘画指路</div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"></span></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">Midjourney&gt; 对硬件没有什么要求、我不会用（笑）</span><br></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">https://www.midjourney.com/home/</span><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></span></div><span style=\"\"><div><span style=\"\"></span></div><span style=\"\"><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">&lt;S</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">table Diffusion&gt;对硬件有要求要用老黄的显卡即N卡 人家研究20年AI了股价当时都跌到10块</span><br></span></div><div><span style=\"\">没有N卡也可以用CPU画，但应该效果不理想没试过。</span></div><div><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"\">秋葉aaaki 赛博菩萨（男）B站主页&nbsp;<span style=\"\">https://space.bilibili.com/12566101</span></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">V4整合包下载地址&nbsp;<span style=\"\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iM4y1y7oA/</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></span></div>S D 素材下载网址 https://civitai.com/ 黄图太多了所以4月被墙了 需要科学方法</span></span><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">（这个网站很重要）</span></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">冷知识：显卡区块链算币子简称 挖矿，显卡SD画猫娘简称 炼丹。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div></span><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"></span></span></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">情怀天子</span></div></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">嫂子-迪瓦茨</span></span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\">迪瓦茨的名字不难记，甚至比嫂子本名好记。哈哈<div><br><div style=\"text-align: center;\">嫂子图特置顶头图</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"594\" data-height=\"398\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_594/h_398/1069/87565/2022/11/21/333829.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_594/h_398/1069/87565/2022/11/21/333829.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"2000\" data-height=\"1168\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_2000/h_1168/1069/87565/2022/11/21/161166.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_2000/h_1168/1069/87565/2022/11/21/161166.jpg\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 291px;\"></div><br></div></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line4\"></div><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">嫂子会下岗么？想屁吃呢，重做加新皮肤。</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"1014\" data-height=\"1024\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1014/h_1024/1069/72324/2022/11/7/90785.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1014/h_1024/1069/72324/2022/11/7/90785.png\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1014/h_1024/1069/72324/2022/11/7/90785.png\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"8\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 505px;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">求嫂子别在培养我的牛头人属性了</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">金总-优诺</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\">我估计金总暂时不打算加强自己<br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2021/1626243561_c98bc3df7c4e0c3bcac6463b7c364004.gif\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - 21/07/15 改版公告 image 27\" data-v-9daed42e=\"\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2021/1626243561_c98bc3df7c4e0c3bcac6463b7c364004.gif\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); height: 400px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); width: 300px;\" data-width=\"450\" data-height=\"600\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\">这个人长得和优诺有几分相似是吧（滑稽）</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"536\" data-height=\"818\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_536/h_818/1069/87565/2022/11/21/667874.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_536/h_818/1069/87565/2022/11/21/667874.jpg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 305px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">世界名画——牡丹</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\">这张图没没玩这个游戏的时候就见到了，牡丹是血攞的人设，但这个魂卡画面是另一位画师的作品</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\">牡丹真的人设真好看，当年给我极大的震撼，即便是现在画风人设也勉强不过时。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"614\" data-height=\"1024\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_614/h_1024/1069/87565/2022/11/22/46088.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_614/h_1024/1069/87565/2022/11/22/46088.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 500px;\"><img data-width=\"1050\" data-height=\"1680\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1050/h_1680/1069/107851/2022/9/14/21101.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1050/h_1680/1069/107851/2022/9/14/21101.png\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1050/h_1680/1069/107851/2022/9/14/21101.png\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"5\" style=\"width: 313px; height: 500px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\">牡丹的通用地位逐渐消失然后怎么说，出新皮肤加强了呗。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"726\" data-height=\"1024\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_726/h_1024/1069/159239/2022/5/22/716115.png\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_726/h_1024/1069/159239/2022/5/22/716115.png\" class=\"lazy-img img-view-ele\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_726/h_1024/1069/159239/2022/5/22/716115.png\" lazy=\"loaded\" img-count=\"24\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 423px;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">入坑一张图 NO.01 魂卡-奶妈</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\">远古大佬都说奶妈这张魂卡是入坑神图，而且也是DC的第一张魂卡，血攞的画作。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_614/h_1024/1069/92835/2022/7/19/809381.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,w_1600\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 500px;\" data-width=\"614\" data-height=\"1024\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;奶妈能有什么地位呢，首先游戏里这么多奶，但能配的上这个称呼的就这位，奶界常青树，最早一批天子，真正的萌新之友。什么模式扛不住都可以上。</div><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;人物的造型剑灵味十足，意思就是金总的老画风老设计。看这个画风，估计可能是比剑灵还要古老的人设（2011年以前）。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"542\" data-height=\"795\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_542/h_795/1069/87565/2022/11/22/862549.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_542/h_795/1069/87565/2022/11/22/862549.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 440px;\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">一切美好的女性——嫦娥</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;备注说和嫦娥无关只是取了这个名字，但多少有点意思。而且我总觉得除了迪瓦茨以外嫦娥，应该和嫂子有点渊源。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;而且嫦娥的强度我来K站这些人就说是永远的神，当嫦娥刚有点力不从心退居2线，怎么说，加强了还出了新皮肤，这下不像嫦娥了，哥特萝莉了。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;除了皮肤众多还早早的有一个木刀（当时很强），并且为很多张魂卡的卡面角色。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"559\" data-height=\"838\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_559/h_838/1069/87565/2022/11/22/607629.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_559/h_838/1069/87565/2022/11/22/607629.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 449px;\"><img data-width=\"1024\" data-height=\"1010\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1024/h_1010/1069/72324/2022/11/7/240988.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1024/h_1010/1069/72324/2022/11/7/240988.png\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1024/h_1010/1069/72324/2022/11/7/240988.png\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"39\" style=\"width: 393.211px; height: 400px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><img data-width=\"360\" data-height=\"202\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_360/h_202/1069/87565/2022/11/22/285649.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_360/h_202/1069/87565/2022/11/22/285649.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">人气路痴——伊芙</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">人气角色NO.1</span></div><div>免费皮肤直接送到邮箱不给伊芙迷路的机会直接送怀里了属于是。</div><img data-width=\"800\" data-height=\"916\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_800/h_916/1069/107851/2022/8/14/168747.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_800/h_916/1069/107851/2022/8/14/168747.png\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_800/h_916/1069/107851/2022/8/14/168747.png\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"7\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 343px;\"><div><br></div><div>这个温泉皮这小眼神，一下击中了我的额........心巴。</div><div><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611732622755_48494318.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611732622755_48494318.png\" alt=\"苍炎伊芙\" data-width=\"512\" data-height=\"512\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611732622755_48494318.png\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"6\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\"><div><br></div></div><div>暗伊芙的形象大气，优雅，圣洁，帅气。形象设计应该是借鉴了龙背上的骑兵。</div><div>形象和气质都挺像的，眼睛上也有一朵小花。</div><div><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611732601832_17525461.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611732601832_17525461.png\" alt=\"苍炎伊芙\" data-width=\"1480\" data-height=\"2142\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611732601832_17525461.png\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"4\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 434px;\"><img data-width=\"536\" data-height=\"758\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_536/h_758/1069/87565/2022/11/22/198899.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_536/h_758/1069/87565/2022/11/22/198899.jpg\" style=\"width: 299px; height: 434px;\"><br></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">玩梗天子</span></div></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">画师们的作品</span></div></div><br></span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(15,20,25);font-size:20px;font-weight:800;\">KKUEMㆍクエム —— 推特</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">嫂子——金总的粉丝头子</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;在2000年的时候金总名气渐胜的画风还比较受争议，嫂子就是金总的知名粉了，在熟人的介绍下相识。然后就成为了嫂子。这俩人都是什么神仙画师。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br></span></div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;NIKKE<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">的</span>玛丽安的形象设计，原本以为是女主，和指挥官关系会很好的那种，现在虽然不是女主，但貌似人类时期就认识指挥官了。<div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"582\" data-height=\"827\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_582/h_827/1069/87565/2022/11/22/692929.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_582/h_827/1069/87565/2022/11/22/692929.png\"></div><br></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;嫂子还是V家韩国部分SeeU人设画师，嫂子的头像还是初音未来，其实当时大家都喜欢V家。并且推特的顶部封面就是<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">SeeU（<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">且金味十足</span>）。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" draggable=\"true\" src=\"//pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/106275770/1431695084/600x200\" class=\"css-9pa8cd\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line4\"></div></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">如果大家觉得嫂子画的都不够色就错了，这二位</div></div><div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"587\" data-height=\"485\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_587/h_485/1069/87565/2022/11/21/885496.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_587/h_485/1069/87565/2022/11/21/885496.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line4\"></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\">还有这个连和谐版都厚被和谐的福尔基斯，和游戏里面氪金皮不一样的姿势哦。<br></div></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"593\" data-height=\"437\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_593/h_437/1069/87565/2022/11/21/372780.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_593/h_437/1069/87565/2022/11/21/372780.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;其他的还有修女米莉安、火奶卡库斯奶牛皮肤、火相机卢萨卡和她<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">罗密欧阿提斯</span>、木大奶、呼啦圈乌波斯、火伞巴托里、木伞巴托里、苍蓝伊芙、嫦娥紫阳花魂卡、联动雪初音（嫂子头像）这个图在P站挺出名的。摩根和他的伙伴......</div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"740\" data-height=\"1047\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_740/h_1047/1069/87565/2022/11/22/178008.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_740/h_1047/1069/87565/2022/11/22/178008.jpg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 282px;\"><img data-width=\"740\" data-height=\"1047\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_740/h_1047/1069/87565/2022/11/22/831307.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_740/h_1047/1069/87565/2022/11/22/831307.jpg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 282px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"609\" data-height=\"768\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_609/h_768/1069/87565/2022/11/22/528254.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_609/h_768/1069/87565/2022/11/22/528254.jpg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 252px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"740\" data-height=\"1071\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_740/h_1071/1069/87565/2022/11/22/441997.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_740/h_1071/1069/87565/2022/11/22/441997.jpg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 289px;\"><img data-width=\"740\" data-height=\"1071\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_740/h_1071/1069/87565/2022/11/22/646190.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_740/h_1071/1069/87565/2022/11/22/646190.jpg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 289px;\"><img data-width=\"740\" data-height=\"1071\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_740/h_1071/1069/87565/2022/11/22/92684.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_740/h_1071/1069/87565/2022/11/22/92684.jpg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 289px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"740\" data-height=\"1071\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_740/h_1071/1069/87565/2022/11/22/551512.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_740/h_1071/1069/87565/2022/11/22/551512.jpg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 289px;\"><img data-width=\"740\" data-height=\"1071\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_740/h_1071/1069/87565/2022/11/22/380209.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_740/h_1071/1069/87565/2022/11/22/380209.jpg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 289px;\"><img data-width=\"481\" data-height=\"680\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_481/h_680/1069/87565/2022/11/22/332512.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_481/h_680/1069/87565/2022/11/22/332512.jpg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 282px;\"><img data-width=\"720\" data-height=\"899\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_720/h_899/1069/87565/2022/11/22/222334.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_720/h_899/1069/87565/2022/11/22/222334.jpg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 249px;\"></div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line4\"></div><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">这张做成魂卡岂不妙哉</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"600\" data-height=\"1000\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_600/h_1000/1069/87565/2022/11/22/25762.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_600/h_1000/1069/87565/2022/11/22/25762.jpg\"></div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line4\"></div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">不会有人看不出VVA是老画作吧，真是太宠嫂子了出道即战神。</div><div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"588\" data-height=\"420\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_588/h_420/1069/87565/2022/11/21/170605.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_588/h_420/1069/87565/2022/11/21/170605.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line4\"></div></div><br></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"></div>\n                               </div><br><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container active-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">血攞<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">”</span>志同道合“的<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">”</span>大徒弟“（更新中）</span></span></span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div>血羅的插画相当有辨识度画面精美，细节非常优秀，上色饱和度高，<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">身材饱和度也高（指双开门冰箱），</span>精美又浮夸的妆容，爆炸冲击力的的身材这谁顶得住啊。</div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">目前画的天子统计有</span></p></div><br></div><div>5★</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">4★</span><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">3★</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">P站画作</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">三星天子是血羅作画就是最大的奢侈</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div></span><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"936\" data-height=\"1287\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_936/h_1287/1069/87565/2023/4/25/964492.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_936/h_1287/1069/87565/2023/4/25/964492.jpg\" style=\"width: 347px; height: 477px;\"><img data-width=\"936\" data-height=\"1287\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_936/h_1287/1069/87565/2023/4/25/372526.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_936/h_1287/1069/87565/2023/4/25/372526.jpg\" style=\"width: 347px; height: 477px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1200\" data-height=\"1800\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1200/h_1800/1069/87565/2023/4/25/882993.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1200/h_1800/1069/87565/2023/4/25/882993.jpg\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;width:347px;height:520px;\"><img data-width=\"1200\" data-height=\"1800\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1200/h_1800/1069/87565/2023/4/25/592306.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1200/h_1800/1069/87565/2023/4/25/592306.jpg\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;width:347px;height:520px;\"><br></div></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">巴里的设计形象设计非常棒，皮肤在当年也是顶尖一流插画。放到现在也不是二流画师能比的。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"1500\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1125/h_1500/1069/87565/2023/4/25/272036.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1125/h_1500/1069/87565/2023/4/25/272036.jpg\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;width:347px;height:462px;\"><img data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"1500\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1125/h_1500/1069/87565/2023/4/25/743816.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1125/h_1500/1069/87565/2023/4/25/743816.jpg\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;width:347px;height:462px;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1500\" data-height=\"1781\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1500/h_1781/1069/87565/2023/4/25/74267.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1500/h_1781/1069/87565/2023/4/25/74267.jpg\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;震惊于血羅对细节的刻画，这黑丝纹理（笑），放大了好好看看吧。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;不知道是显示器像素点的原因还是这就是真实的视觉效果，这个丝袜的纹理在缩小画面的时候会产生椭圆形竖向纹理，像是高度地图的等高线一样，在现实生活中也可能会产生这种视觉效果，尤其是里外穿了两层丝袜时。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;其实在其他物体上也可以看到相同效果，通常在两个有均匀且致密镂空纹理的扁片物体重叠并轻微错开时。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><img data-width=\"925\" data-height=\"2025\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_925/h_2025/1069/87565/2023/4/25/424262.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_925/h_2025/1069/87565/2023/4/25/424262.jpg\" style=\"width:347px;height:759px;\"><img data-width=\"1200\" data-height=\"2325\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1200/h_2325/1069/87565/2023/4/25/222250.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1200/h_2325/1069/87565/2023/4/25/222250.jpg\" style=\"width:347px;height:672px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><img data-width=\"2250\" data-height=\"2625\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_2250/h_2